<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>프레시 마켓</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stud11/stylesheets/style.css">
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; background-color: #f9fafb; color: #111827; }
        header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 18px 40px; background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; }
        .header-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 35px; }
        .header-left h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.4em; font-weight: 800; color: #10b981; }
        nav { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
        nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #4b5563; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95em; }
        nav a:hover { color: #10b981; }
        .auth-zone { font-size: 0.9em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
        .auth-zone a { color: #4b5563; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
        .user-tag { font-weight: 600; color: #047857; background-color: #ecfdf5; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; }

        /* 홈 화면 웰컴 섹션 스타일 */
        .welcome-container { max-width: 800px; margin: 110px auto; padding: 0 20px; text-align: center; }
        .welcome-badge { display: inline-block; background-color: #ecfdf5; color: #10b981; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 25px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }

        /* 👑 한 줄 한 줄 정갈하게 떨어지도록 타이틀 자간 및 높이 세팅 */
        .welcome-title { font-size: 2.8em; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0 0 25px 0; letter-spacing: -1px; }
        .welcome-title span { color: #10b981; }
        .welcome-desc { font-size: 1.2em; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 40px 0; font-weight: 400; word-break: keep-all; }

        .cta-box { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 16px; }
        .btn-primary { display: inline-block; padding: 16px 32px; background-color: #10b981; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 14px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05em; transition: background 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); }
        .btn-primary:hover { background-color: #059669; }
        .btn-secondary { display: inline-block; padding: 16px 32px; background-color: #ffffff; color: #4b5563; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 14px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.05em; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .btn-secondary:hover { background-color: #f9fafb; color: #111827; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <div class="header-left">
        <h1>🌱 프레시 마켓</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="/stud11/">홈</a>
            <a href="/stud11/shop/products">추천상품</a>
            <a href="/stud11/shop/products/all">전체상품</a>
            <a href="/stud11/shop/cart">장바구니 (<%= typeof cartCount !== 'undefined' ? cartCount : (typeof cartItems !== 'undefined' ? cartItems.length : 0) %>)</a>
            <a href="/stud11/post/list">고객센터</a>

            <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user && (user.id === 'admin' || user.username === 'admin')) { %>
                <a href="/stud11/admin" style="color: #ef4444; font-weight: 700;">👑 관리자 대시보드</a>
            <% } %>
        </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="auth-zone">
        <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
            <span class="user-tag">👤 <%= user.username || user.id %>님</span>
            <span style="color: #e5e7eb;">|</span>
            <a href="/stud11/mypage">마이페이지</a>
            <span style="color: #e5e7eb;">|</span>
            <a href="/stud11/logout" style="color: #ef4444;">로그아웃</a>
        <% } else { %>
            <a href="/stud11/login">로그인</a>
            <span style="color: #e5e7eb;">|</span>
            <a href="/stud11/register">회원가입</a>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <div class="welcome-container">
        <div class="welcome-badge">🌱 매일 아침 찾아오는 싱싱함</div>

        <h2 class="welcome-title">
            당일 수확한 신선한 과일이<br>
            <span>여러분의 식탁까지 보내드립니다</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="welcome-desc">
            중간 유통 없이 농가의 정성을 당일 입고를 통해 빠르게 전해드립니다.<br>
            지금 프레시 마켓에서 확인해 보세요.        </p>
        <div class="cta-box">
            <a href="/stud11/shop/products/all" class="btn-primary">📦 전체 상품 보러가기</a>
            <a href="/stud11/shop/products" class="btn-secondary">✨ MD 추천 상품</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>